# `.tools/` - downloaded binaries (k6). Never committed; see scripts/load/README.md
.tools/

# `.data/` - PGlite database directory. Used by `npm run start:local`.
#
# The leading dot MATTERS. This read `data/` for its whole life, which matches a directory
# named `data` and not `.data` - so the PGlite database was never ignored. 997 files and
# 38 MB were committed in cda7007 before it was noticed. `scripts/check-ignore.mjs` now
# asserts this rule actually covers the path, so a typo here fails the build instead of
# quietly admitting a database.
.data/
data/

